OL,3,AHundreds of applications, no replies:
OL,4,AInside the job ghosting problemb@L
OL,5,
OL,6,FHave you ever applied for a job or
OL,7,Fattended an interview, only to hear
OL,8,Fabsolutely nothing back from the
OL,9,Femployer?
OL,11,FSo-called "job ghosting" has become a
OL,12,Fbig problem for jobseekers in the UK,
OL,13,Fleaving them "demoralised", denting
OL,14,Ftheir confidence and undermining their
OL,15,Fhopes of finding work.
OL,17,FIt's an issue that was mentioned in
OL,18,Fformer minister Alan Milburn's major
OL,19,Freview into young people who are not in
OL,20,Femployment, education or training -
OL,21,Fthose dubbed as Neets - this week.
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,115,105,200,300,0,100
