OL,3,AHundreds of applications, no replies:
OL,4,AInside the job ghosting problemb@L
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmong his recommendations - aimed at
OL,7,Freducing the proportion of Neets from
OL,8,F13% to about 5% by 2036 - Milburn
OL,9,Fproposed that large employers should
OL,10,Fgive all unsuccessful job applicants
OL,11,Funder 25 "meaningful feedback".
